					"content": "Unlike our chief, I don't have the guts to challenge our traditions. This task is specifically appointed to someone by the Iktomisaur Elder. Who knows what bad things might happen if I got involved?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150250311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150250311,
					"content": "Fair enough. Alright, we'll try not to take too long!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
