				},
				{
					"id": 150251002,
					"content": "It's gorgeous!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251003,
					"content": "Now, try looking a little further.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251004,
					"content": "Whoa... That graffiti...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251005,
					"content": "In all the years since the founding of our tribe, those colors have been with us every step of the way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251006,
					"content": "It is true that I seek to bring new life to this ancient tribe through change and reform. But I also understand there are certain foundational things that we cannot afford to throw away.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251007,
					"content": "The foremost of these is the way we record our history.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251008,
					"content": "That makes sense.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251009,
					"content": "Since the very beginnings, our tribe has always sought to bring color to history, and I have a deep sense that this is one part of our heritage that we should not give up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251010,
					"content": "So whatever it takes, I must find a way for us to continue producing our traditional woven scrolls.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251011,
					"content": "You're completely right. Paimon's sorry for what she said earlier. It was out of line...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251012,
					"content": "It's quite alright. I'm just grateful you're able to understand where I'm coming from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251013,
					"content": "We're committed to helping you solve this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150251014,
					"content": "Then let us hope that when we next meet, we succeed in reviving this tradition.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Biram",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Chief, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				}
			]
		},
