			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150251501,
					"content": "So the dye is somewhere in this cave, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251502,
					"content": "This is as far as I can take you. Only the appointed ones may proceed from here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251503,
					"content": "Why's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251504,
					"content": "Kind of a long story. Apparently, there's a certain fruit that grows in this cave, the juice of which can be processed to make an excellent dye.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251505,
					"content": "Many years ago, our ancestors set out to make a series of ambitious works of graffiti art. They selected this cave to make them in, presumably due to the availability of the dye.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251506,
					"content": "However, they didn't want anyone to see their work before it was completed. And so, they sealed off the entrance to control access.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251507,
					"content": "To bypass the seal, you have to have mastered the art of color perception, or something like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150251508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Toltec"
				},
				{
					"id": 150251508,
					"content": "Oh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
